-- E2E fixture data set for authors: people with their aliases, locations and groups. Stable ids: tests may reference them.
-- Enough entries for more than one catalog page of 100, under Latin, Cyrillic and the rest letters.
-- Every person has a real name of the country they live in and a preferred nickname, but one known only by the real name.
-- Person ...0003-{n}; alias k of person n ...0004-{n * 10 + k}; group ...0005-{g}; location ...0006-{n * 10 + k}.
-- Locations refer to the geo fixtures (R__1_geo.sql).
